  · exact GlobalTheory.T.ker_baseChangedReduction_eq_span_X T O A A₁ f i i₁ EA QA jA hcomp hj ρ hρA hρX hunit hρker
  · exact reduceLoc_sub_locMap_mem f i i₁ EA QA jA hcomp hj ρ hρA hρX hunit hcong
